+.Pp
+When the server is also HPN-SSH, compression uses the method
+.Cm huff0@hpnssh.org
+in preference to zlib.
+It codes each packet on its own with Huffman coding and keeps no dictionary,
+so it does not have the weakness that led OpenSSH to restrict zlib to
+Huffman coding only.
